{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmgkinx9voN4jnM25JiP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**What I'll tell my son:**\n\n\"I didn't decide anything, and I'm not moving a shekel. Next week I'll ask you, or the clerk at the bank. I saw that Harel has a lot: the top says 'כל המוצרים 105', in 7 kinds, like קופת גמל להשקעה, קרן השתלמות, תגמולים, חיסכון לכל ילד and קרן חדשה מקיפה. The cost is mostly about half a percent a year 'מהחיסכון' (0.41% to 0.67%), and almost always '0%' or 'אין' 'מההפקדות'. Only the pension one, קרן חדשה מקיפה, takes 0.16% from the savings but 1.47% from each deposit. What I liked was 'חיסכון לכל ילד' at 0.01%, because of the grandchildren. The safe-sounding one was 'כספי (שקלי)', with 4.25% over 3 years and 3.08% over 5 years. But nothing on the page told me it's as safe as my deposits, so I'm not sure about anything.\"\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The top: the heading 'הראל' and the sentence about דמי הניהול.\n2. The product buttons.\n3. The קופת גמל להשקעה list.\n4. The קרן השתלמות list.\n5. The תגמולים list.\n6. The top of the חיסכון לכל ילד and קרן חדשה מקיפה lists.\n\nAfter six screens full of numbers I stopped, so I didn't reach the rest of the list.\n\n**What I skipped and didn't understand:**\n- I skipped \"S&P 500\", \"עוקב מדד\", \"מט\"ח\", \"חשיפה\", \"גמיש\" and \"קייימות\".\n- I didn't try to read the little circles. The two colours (turquoise and yellow) look the same to me.\n- I don't know what 'פחות מ־3 שנים' means where a return should be. Does it mean no number?\n- I skipped the small grey line near the top, '123 מקור 123 מחושב', and the little ⓘ and ? signs.\n- I wasn't sure what 'לפני דמי ניהול' means for the return: is the fee still to come off it?\n- I didn't know what 'עוד לא דווח' means.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The whole screen is black, with pale grey writing at the edges. Even enlarged it was hard to read.\n- There were too many numbers on every row.\n- The biggest number that stayed with me was 21% on shares, and that scares me.\n- I didn't see the word פיקדון anywhere, or anything saying what is safe.\n- I don't know who \"מקור\" is. Is it official?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3685,"cache_read_input_tokens":11581,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3685},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"db6a3fe4-ea47-4923-b1d6-6f8b721688d5","uuid":"ca3fa2b8-a7e0-48c1-8046-3e094873a9c1","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:37:34.280Z","request_id":"req_011CgmgkiaKL5HszWMuCvQXz"}
